  "items": [
    {"id":"TW-14-001","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["account_nist"],"change":"不再把所有推播或通行密鑰名稱當作同等驗證強度；保留復原與實作限制。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-002","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["account_nist"],"change":"改用可取得的NIST密碼管理規定，不保證固定輪換能提高所有服務安全。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-003","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["account_sim"],"change":"確認Apple2026-01-28文件日期與SIM／eSIM規則，不改成猜測預設PIN。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-004","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["account_lost_apple","account_lost_android"],"change":"補上Android清除後停止定位與可能不清除SD卡；Apple不可為找回手機而移除啟用鎖定。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-005","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["finconsumer","account_foi","account_card"],"change":"更正扣款用字；核對申訴30日與評議60日起算，不把期限當退款保證。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-006","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["account_password","account_apps"],"change":"補上換密碼的登出例外，撤銷授權不等於刪除第三方既有資料。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-007","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["pdpa"],"change":"區分裝置權限、個資蒐用基礎與拒絕行銷，不宣稱全面拒絕仍可使用所有功能。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-008","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["pdpa","pdpaeffective"],"change":"15／30日為準駁期限，延長需通知；標示2025修法部分未施行。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-009","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["account_biometric_gym","account_biometric_iris"],"change":"核對兩份官方函釋的特定事實與範圍；索引文字取材限制另記。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-010","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["govai","pdpa"],"change":"以已取得的公務AI指引取代未取得頁面，明示私人場景不直接承受同一法定禁令。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-011","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["account_jcic","account_ncc"],"change":"只把聯徵首頁當服務入口，另記NCC具體防詐提醒；不保證查遍所有帳號。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-14-012","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/14-帳號與資訊安全.md","source_ids":["account_recovery","account_recovery_nist"],"change":"補上Google備援資訊7天過渡及其他用途，移除舊電話必立即全面失效的錯誤驗收。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-23-001","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/23-學習技能與職涯發展.md","source_ids":["lsa"],"change":"新增台灣未成年工作與童工保護；不沿用中國16歲及罰款算法。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-23-008","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/23-學習技能與職涯發展.md","source_ids":["skills_certificate"],"change":"新增台灣技術士與各類證明區分，不以中國資格目錄判斷。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"},
    {"id":"TW-23-009","path":"locales/zh-TW/book/23-學習技能與職涯發展.md","source_ids":["skills_training"],"change":"新增台灣在職／失業職訓、補助期間與墊款限制。","stage":"draft_with_source_notes"}
  ],
